    - target: {fileID: 4806542669368481234, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Seq-Ghost (1)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5201841719964422610, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Size.x
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5201841719964422610, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Size.y
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintAr
      value: "\u0627\u0636\u063A\u0637 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u0632\u0631 \u062A\u063A\u064A\u064A\u0631
        \u0627\u0644\u0642\u0646\u0627\u0629 \u0641\u064A \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0644\u0641\u0627\u0632.
        \u062B\u0645 \u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u062F\u0641\u062A\u0631
        \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0644\u0641\u0627\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064A
        \u064A\u0638\u0647\u0631 \u0641\u064A\u0647 \u0634\u0628\u062D."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintCh
      value: "\u70B9\u51FB\u7535\u89C6\u7684\u6362\u53F0\u6309\u94AE\u3002\u7136\u540E\u5C06\u7B14\u8BB0\u672C\u62D6\u5230\u6709\u9B3C\u7684\u7535\u89C6\u4E0A\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintFr
      value: "Appuie sur le bouton de changement de cha\xEEne du t\xE9l\xE9viseur.
        Ensuite fais glisser le cahier vers la t\xE9l\xE9vision avec l\u2019image
        du fant\xF4me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintGe
      value: Tippe auf die Kanaltaste des Fernsehers. Ziehe dann das Heft zum Fernseher
        mit dem Geist.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintHi
      value: "\u091F\u0940\u0935\u0940 \u0915\u0947 \u091A\u0948\u0928\u0932 \u092C\u0926\u0932\u0928\u0947
        \u0935\u093E\u0932\u0947 \u092C\u091F\u0928 \u0915\u094B \u091B\u0941\u0913\u0964
        \u092B\u093F\u0930 \u0915\u0949\u092A\u0940 \u0915\u094B \u0909\u0938 \u091F\u0940\u0935\u0940
        \u092A\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091A\u094B \u091C\u093F\u0938\u092E\u0947\u0902
        \u092D\u0942\u0924 \u0926\u093F\u0916 \u0930\u0939\u093E \u0939\u0948\u0964"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIn
      value: Ketuk tombol ganti saluran TV. Setelah itu seret buku catatan ke TV
        yang menampilkan hantu.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIt
      value: "Tocca il pulsante di cambio canale della TV. Poi trascina il quaderno
        verso la TV con l\u2019immagine del fantasma."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintJa
      value: "\u30C6\u30EC\u30D3\u306E\u30C1\u30E3\u30F3\u30CD\u30EB\u5207\u308A\u66FF\u3048\u30DC\u30BF\u30F3\u3092\u30BF\u30C3\u30D7\u3059\u308B\u3002\u305D\u306E\u5F8C\u3001\u5E7D\u970A\u304C\u6620\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30C6\u30EC\u30D3\u306B\u30CE\u30FC\u30C8\u3092\u30C9\u30E9\u30C3\u30B0\u3059\u308B\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintKo
      value: "TV\uC758 \uCC44\uB110 \uBCC0\uACBD \uBC84\uD2BC\uC744 \uD130\uCE58\uD558\uC138\uC694.
        \uADF8\uB7F0 \uB2E4\uC74C \uC720\uB839\uC774 \uB098\uC624\uB294 TV\uB85C
        \uACF5\uCC45\uC744 \uB4DC\uB798\uADF8\uD558\uC138\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintPo
      value: "Toque no bot\xE3o de mudar de canal da TV. Depois arraste o caderno
        at\xE9 a TV com a imagem do fantasma."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintRu
      value: "\u041D\u0430\u0436\u043C\u0438 \u043D\u0430 \u043A\u043D\u043E\u043F\u043A\u0443
        \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043A\u043B\u044E\u0447\u0435\u043D\u0438\u044F
        \u043A\u0430\u043D\u0430\u043B\u043E\u0432 \u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0437\u043E\u0440\u0430.
        \u0417\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043C \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438
        \u0442\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044C \u043A \u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0437\u043E\u0440\u0443
        \u0441 \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0437\u0440\u0430\u043A\u043E\u043C.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintSp
      value: "Toca el bot\xF3n de cambio de canal del televisor. Luego arrastra el
        cuaderno hacia el televisor con la imagen del fantasma."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTh
