    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintAr
      value: "\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u0639\u0638\u0645\u0629 \u0625\u0644\u0649
        \u0637\u0628\u0642 \u0637\u0639\u0627\u0645 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0644\u0628.
        \u062B\u0645 \u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u062F\u0641\u062A\u0631
        \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0643\u0644\u0628."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintCh
      value: "\u5C06\u9AA8\u5934\u62D6\u5230\u72D7\u7684\u98DF\u7269\u76D8\u4E0A\u3002\u7136\u540E\u5C06\u7B14\u8BB0\u672C\u62D6\u5230\u72D7\u8EAB\u4E0A\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintFr
      value: "Fais glisser l\u2019os vers le bol de nourriture du chien. Ensuite
        fais glisser le cahier vers le chien."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintGe
      value: Ziehe den Knochen in den Futternapf des Hundes. Ziehe dann das Heft
        zum Hund.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintHi
      value: "\u0939\u0921\u094D\u0921\u0940 \u0915\u094B \u0915\u0941\u0924\u094D\u0924\u0947
        \u0915\u0947 \u0916\u093E\u0928\u0947 \u0915\u0940 \u092A\u094D\u0932\u0947\u091F
        \u092E\u0947\u0902 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091A\u094B\u0964 \u092B\u093F\u0930
        \u0915\u0949\u092A\u0940 \u0915\u094B \u0915\u0941\u0924\u094D\u0924\u0947
        \u092A\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091A\u094B\u0964"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIn
      value: Seret tulang ke mangkuk makanan anjing. Setelah itu seret buku catatan
        ke anjing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIt
      value: "Trascina l\u2019osso nel piatto del cibo del cane. Poi trascina il
        quaderno verso il cane."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintJa
      value: "\u9AA8\u3092\u72AC\u306E\u990C\u76BF\u306B\u30C9\u30E9\u30C3\u30B0\u3059\u308B\u3002\u305D\u306E\u5F8C\u3001\u30CE\u30FC\u30C8\u3092\u72AC\u306B\u30C9\u30E9\u30C3\u30B0\u3059\u308B\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintKo
      value: "\uBF08\uB97C \uAC1C\uC758 \uBC25\uADF8\uB987\uC5D0 \uB4DC\uB798\uADF8\uD558\uC138\uC694.
        \uADF8\uB7F0 \uB2E4\uC74C \uACF5\uCC45\uC744 \uAC1C\uC5D0\uAC8C \uB4DC\uB798\uADF8\uD558\uC138\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintPo
      value: "Arraste o osso at\xE9 o prato de comida do cachorro. Depois arraste
        o caderno at\xE9 o cachorro."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintRu
      value: "\u041F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438 \u043A\u043E\u0441\u0442\u044C
        \u0432 \u043C\u0438\u0441\u043A\u0443 \u0441 \u0435\u0434\u043E\u0439 \u0434\u043B\u044F
        \u0441\u043E\u0431\u0430\u043A\u0438. \u0417\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043C \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438
        \u0442\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044C \u043A \u0441\u043E\u0431\u0430\u043A\u0435.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintSp
      value: Arrastra el hueso hacia el plato de comida del perro. Luego arrastra
        el cuaderno hacia el perro.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTh
      value: "\u0E25\u0E32\u0E01\u0E01\u0E23\u0E30\u0E14\u0E39\u0E01\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E08\u0E32\u0E19\u0E2D\u0E32\u0E2B\u0E32\u0E23\u0E02\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E2A\u0E38\u0E19\u0E31\u0E02
        \u0E08\u0E32\u0E01\u0E19\u0E31\u0E49\u0E19\u0E25\u0E32\u0E01\u0E2A\u0E21\u0E38\u0E14\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E2A\u0E38\u0E19\u0E31\u0E02"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTu
      value: "Kemi\u011Fi k\xF6pe\u011Fin mama kab\u0131na s\xFCr\xFCkle. Ard\u0131ndan
        defteri k\xF6pe\u011Fe s\xFCr\xFCkle."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintVi
      value: "K\xE9o C\u1EE5c X\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0o \u0110\u0129a Th\u1EE9c \u0102n
        C\u1EE7a Ch\xF3. Sau \u0111\xF3 k\xE9o Quy\u1EC3n V\u1EDF v\xE0o Con Ch\xF3."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintEng
