    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintAr
      value: "\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628 \u0627\u0644\u062F\u0641\u062A\u0631 \u0625\u0644\u0649
        \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0644\u0641\u0627\u0632 \u0627\u0644\u0630\u064A \u064A\u0638\u0647\u0631
        \u0641\u064A\u0647 \u0634\u0628\u062D \u064A\u0642\u0648\u0645 \u0628\u0639\u0645\u0644
        \u0627\u0644\u0648\u0627\u062C\u0628."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintCh
      value: "\u5C06\u7B14\u8BB0\u672C\u62D6\u5230\u6709\u6B63\u5728\u505A\u4F5C\u4E1A\u7684\u9B3C\u7684\u7535\u89C6\u4E0A\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintFr
      value: "Fais glisser le cahier vers la t\xE9l\xE9vision avec l\u2019image du
        fant\xF4me en train de faire ses devoirs."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintGe
      value: Ziehe das Heft zum Fernseher mit dem Geist der Hausaufgaben macht.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintHi
      value: "\u0915\u0949\u092A\u0940 \u0915\u094B \u0909\u0938 \u091F\u0940\u0935\u0940
        \u092A\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091A\u094B \u091C\u093F\u0938\u092E\u0947\u0902
        \u092D\u0942\u0924 \u0939\u094B\u092E\u0935\u0930\u094D\u0915 \u0915\u0930
        \u0930\u0939\u093E \u0939\u0948\u0964"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIn
      value: Seret buku catatan ke TV yang menampilkan hantu yang sedang mengerjakan
        pekerjaan rumah.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIt
      value: "Trascina il quaderno verso la TV con l\u2019immagine del fantasma che
        fa i compiti."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintJa
      value: "\u5BBF\u984C\u3092\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308B\u5E7D\u970A\u304C\u6620\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308B\u30C6\u30EC\u30D3\u306B\u30CE\u30FC\u30C8\u3092\u30C9\u30E9\u30C3\u30B0\u3059\u308B\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintKo
      value: "\uC219\uC81C\uB97C \uD558\uACE0 \uC788\uB294 \uC720\uB839\uC774 \uB098\uC624\uB294
        TV\uB85C \uACF5\uCC45\uC744 \uB4DC\uB798\uADF8\uD558\uC138\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintPo
      value: "Arraste o caderno at\xE9 a TV com a imagem do fantasma fazendo a li\xE7\xE3o
        de casa."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintRu
      value: "\u041F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438 \u0442\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044C
        \u043A \u0442\u0435\u043B\u0435\u0432\u0438\u0437\u043E\u0440\u0443 \u0441
        \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0437\u0440\u0430\u043A\u043E\u043C \u043A\u043E\u0442\u043E\u0440\u044B\u0439
        \u0434\u0435\u043B\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0434\u043E\u043C\u0430\u0448\u043D\u0435\u0435
        \u0437\u0430\u0434\u0430\u043D\u0438\u0435.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintSp
      value: Arrastra el cuaderno hacia el televisor con la imagen del fantasma haciendo
        la tarea.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTh
      value: "\u0E25\u0E32\u0E01\u0E2A\u0E21\u0E38\u0E14\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E17\u0E35\u0E27\u0E35\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E21\u0E35\u0E20\u0E32\u0E1E\u0E1C\u0E35\u0E01\u0E33\u0E25\u0E31\u0E07\u0E17\u0E33\u0E01\u0E32\u0E23\u0E1A\u0E49\u0E32\u0E19"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTu
      value: "Defteri \xF6dev yapan hayaletin oldu\u011Fu TV'ye s\xFCr\xFCkle."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintVi
      value: "K\xE9o Quy\u1EC3n V\u1EDF v\xE0o TV C\xF3 H\xECnh Con Ma \u0110ang
        L\xE0m B\xE0i T\u1EADp."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintEng
      value: Drag The Notebook onto The TV with The Ghost Doing Homework.
