    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintAr
      value: "\u0627\u0636\u063A\u0637 \u0639\u0644\u0649 \u063A\u0637\u0627\u0621
        \u0641\u062A\u062D\u0629 \u0627\u0644\u062A\u0647\u0648\u064A\u0629 \u0648\u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628\u0647
        \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u062E\u0627\u0631\u062C. \u062B\u0645 \u0627\u0633\u062D\u0628
        \u0627\u0644\u062F\u0641\u062A\u0631 \u0625\u0644\u0649 \u0627\u0644\u0641\u0623\u0631."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintCh
      value: "\u70B9\u51FB\u901A\u98CE\u53E3\u6321\u677F\u5E76\u5C06\u5176\u62C9\u5F00\u3002\u7136\u540E\u5C06\u7B14\u8BB0\u672C\u62D6\u5230\u8001\u9F20\u4E0A\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintFr
      value: "Appuie sur la grille de ventilation et tire-la vers l\u2019ext\xE9rieur.
        Ensuite fais glisser le cahier vers la souris."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintGe
      value: "Tippe auf die L\xFCftungsabdeckung und ziehe sie heraus. Ziehe dann
        das Heft zur Maus."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintHi
      value: "\u0935\u0947\u0902\u091F\u093F\u0932\u0947\u0936\u0928 \u0915\u0935\u0930
        \u0915\u094B \u091B\u0942\u0915\u0930 \u092C\u093E\u0939\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091A\u094B\u0964
        \u092B\u093F\u0930 \u0915\u0949\u092A\u0940 \u0915\u094B \u091A\u0942\u0939\u0947
        \u092A\u0930 \u0916\u0940\u0902\u091A\u094B\u0964"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIn
      value: Ketuk penutup ventilasi lalu tarik keluar. Setelah itu seret buku catatan
        ke tikus.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintIt
      value: Tocca la griglia di ventilazione e tirala fuori. Poi trascina il quaderno
        verso il topo.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintJa
      value: "\u901A\u6C17\u53E3\u306E\u30AB\u30D0\u30FC\u3092\u30BF\u30C3\u30D7\u3057\u3066\u5916\u3078\u5F15\u304D\u51FA\u3059\u3002\u305D\u306E\u5F8C\u3001\u30CE\u30FC\u30C8\u3092\u30CD\u30BA\u30DF\u306B\u30C9\u30E9\u30C3\u30B0\u3059\u308B\u3002"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintKo
      value: "\uD658\uD48D\uAD6C \uB36E\uAC1C\uB97C \uD130\uCE58\uD55C \uD6C4 \uBC14\uAE65\uC73C\uB85C
        \uB04C\uC5B4\uB0B4\uC138\uC694. \uADF8\uB7F0 \uB2E4\uC74C \uACF5\uCC45\uC744
        \uC950\uC5D0\uAC8C \uB4DC\uB798\uADF8\uD558\uC138\uC694."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintPo
      value: "Toque na grade de ventila\xE7\xE3o e puxe para fora. Depois arraste
        o caderno at\xE9 o rato."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintRu
      value: "\u041D\u0430\u0436\u043C\u0438 \u043D\u0430 \u0432\u0435\u043D\u0442\u0438\u043B\u044F\u0446\u0438\u043E\u043D\u043D\u0443\u044E
        \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0451\u0442\u043A\u0443 \u0438 \u0432\u044B\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438
        \u0435\u0451. \u0417\u0430\u0442\u0435\u043C \u043F\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0442\u0430\u0449\u0438
        \u0442\u0435\u0442\u0440\u0430\u0434\u044C \u043A \u043C\u044B\u0448\u0438.\r"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintSp
      value: "Toca la rejilla de ventilaci\xF3n y arr\xE1strala hacia afuera. Luego
        arrastra el cuaderno hacia el rat\xF3n."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTh
      value: "\u0E41\u0E15\u0E30\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E1D\u0E32\u0E1B\u0E34\u0E14\u0E0A\u0E48\u0E2D\u0E07\u0E23\u0E30\u0E1A\u0E32\u0E22\u0E2D\u0E32\u0E01\u0E32\u0E28\u0E41\u0E25\u0E49\u0E27\u0E25\u0E32\u0E01\u0E2D\u0E2D\u0E01
        \u0E08\u0E32\u0E01\u0E19\u0E31\u0E49\u0E19\u0E25\u0E32\u0E01\u0E2A\u0E21\u0E38\u0E14\u0E44\u0E1B\u0E17\u0E35\u0E48\u0E2B\u0E19\u0E39"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintTu
      value: "Havaland\u0131rma kapa\u011F\u0131na dokun ve d\u0131\u015Far\u0131
        \xE7ek. Ard\u0131ndan defteri fareye s\xFCr\xFCkle."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintVi
      value: "Ch\u1EA1m v\xE0o T\u1EA5m Ch\u1EAFn \u1ED0ng Th\xF4ng Gi\xF3 r\u1ED3i
        k\xE9o ra xa. Sau \u0111\xF3 k\xE9o Quy\u1EC3n V\u1EDF v\xE0o Con Chu\u1ED9t."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: hintEng
      value: Tap The Vent Cover and drag it away. Then drag The Notebook onto The
        Mouse.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6505470743493491441, guid: 97d575d281362a24ca1291c3b08bb10a, type: 3}
